<title>USA: Michigan $40 mln housing authority bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>Michigan $40 mln housing authority bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced Michigan State Housing Development Authority's $40 million mortgage bond deal. The top tax-exempt yield at the repricing was 6.05 percent in 2027.</p>
